      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 4.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "hello sorry about the delay do sit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.41,
      "end_seconds": 7.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Evening, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.19,
      "end_seconds": 11.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "tell me what's brought you in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.46,
      "end_seconds": 17.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Um, so... vomiting blood. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.47,
      "end_seconds": 22.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.21,
      "end_seconds": 38.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.5,
      "end_seconds": 64.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 19, pulse 108, BP is 138 over 70. Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.32,
      "end_seconds": 73.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "it's been three weeks now i thought it would sort itself out but it hasn't"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.39,
      "end_seconds": 77.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "how much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.29,
      "end_seconds": 80.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Moderate, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.9,
      "end_seconds": 83.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Have you been feeling faint?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.21,
      "end_seconds": 88.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.27,
      "end_seconds": 93.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "any chest pain or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.67,
      "end_seconds": 97.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "no chest pain or fever none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.68,
      "end_seconds": 101.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.45,
      "end_seconds": 104.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.31,
      "end_seconds": 106.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "how's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.55,
      "end_seconds": 110.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "No nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.78,
      "end_seconds": 131.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.69,
      "end_seconds": 141.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "text": "Years back I got swelling of my lips from diclofenac, so I stay away from it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.47,
      "end_seconds": 161.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.59,
      "end_seconds": 167.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Mm I've had high blood pressure for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.6,
      "end_seconds": 171.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.45,
      "end_seconds": 177.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.42,
      "end_seconds": 181.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.29,
      "end_seconds": 187.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.92,
      "end_seconds": 208.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "alright, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.56,
      "end_seconds": 213.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.27,
      "end_seconds": 220.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Okay, I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.31,
      "end_seconds": 224.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.37,
      "end_seconds": 247.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "you look pale, your pulse is fast and your tummy is tender at the top"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.07,
      "end_seconds": 268.42,
      "duration_seconds": 16.35,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Taking everything into account, I think we're dealing with a possible bleeding stomach ulcer at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.28,
      "end_seconds": 299.48,
      "duration_seconds": 22.2,
      "text": "Let's book urgent blood tests to look into bleeding. Please stop the ibuprofen and do not eat or drink. Do get help quickly if you vomit again. Please come and see me straight away. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.44,
      "end_seconds": 303.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "alright, thanks, take care"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.37,
      "end_seconds": 306.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}